  "instructions": [
    "In a blender or food processor, combine mirepoix, garlic, cinnamon, cumin, and coriander. Blend until smooth.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together yogurt and mirepoix mixture. Add lamb and mix until coated.",
    "Cover and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "Preheat robata grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Thread lamb onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
